### =========================================================================
### 🎓 PAGINATION — ?page= at ?limit=
### 📅 Day 47 · Phase 10 (Roles at admin)
### =========================================================================
### Hindi kailanman ibinibigay ang LAHAT ng row. Isang page lang bawat request:
###   ?page=2&limit=20  → laktawan ang 20 (OFFSET), kunin ang susunod na 20 (LIMIT)
###   default: page 1, limit 20 · max: limit 100, page 1,000,000
###
### Sagot: { users: [...], page, limit, total, totalPages }
###
### Kailangan: naka-login bilang ADMIN (tingnan ang 13-admin-rbac.http). Palitan ang email/password
### sa #1 ng dev admin mo (hal. ginawa gamit ang `npm run db:set-role -- <email> admin`).
###
### Code: backend/src/validations/pagination.ts · backend/src/services/admin.service.ts (listUsers, Day 76)
### Test: validations/pagination.test.ts · routes/pagination.test.ts
### =========================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Mag-login bilang admin. Ang inaasahan: 200
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nelson1869ai@gmail.com",
  "password": "PALITAN-NG-PASSWORD-MO"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Walang query → page 1, limit 20. Ang inaasahan:
###    200 { "users": [...], "page": 1, "limit": 20, "total": N, "totalPages": ... }
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Isang user bawat page. Ang inaasahan: 200 · isang user lang (ang pinakabago) · totalPages = total
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?page=1&limit=1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Page 2. Ang inaasahan: ang SUSUNOD na user — hindi kapareho ng #3 (walang naulit, walang nalaktawan)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?page=2&limit=1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Lampas sa huling page. Ang inaasahan: 200 { "users": [] } — hindi error, wala lang laman
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?page=999&limit=20

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. Sobrang laking limit. Ang inaasahan:
###    400 { "error": "Invalid input", "fields": { "limit": ["Too big: expected number to be <=100"] } }
###    🔐 Kung walang max: ang ?limit=999999 ay magpapabagal sa server at database (at sa browser ng admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?limit=999999

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Hindi numero. Ang inaasahan:
###    400 · fields.page: ["Invalid input: expected number, received NaN"]
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?page=abc

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Napakalaking numero. Ang inaasahan: 400
###    🔍 (Day 47) Si Zod 4 mismo ang tumatanggi sa 1e20 — ang `.int()` ay "safe integer" lang.
###       Ang max natin (1,000,000) ay para sa bilis ng OFFSET, hindi para iwas-500.
GET http://localhost:3000/api/admin/users?page=1e20
